#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bheader.h1:4-4
msgid "Familias"
msgstr "Families"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.p:8-4
msgid ""
"Como célula fundamental del Orden Social Cristiano, Nuestra Señora de la "
"Cristiandad busca que las familias puedan integrarse cada vez más plenamente "
"en la Peregrinación. Por ello, desde su fundación existe la posibilidad de "
"inscribirse en la <a href=\"#familias\" class=\"a4\">ruta de familias</a>, "
"más reducida que la ruta completa y apta para mayores de 6 años. En la VI "
"Peregrinación, en 2026, se añadirá una nueva modalidad de inscripción, la <a "
"href=\"#minirruta\" class=\"a4\">minirruta</a>, adaptada para niños de 0 a 6 "
"años, pues es apta para carritos de bebé. Se describen los detalles de ambas "
"rutas a continuación."
msgstr ""
"As a fundamental unit of the Christian Social Order, Our Lady of Christendom "
"seeks to enable families to become increasingly involved in the Pilgrimage. "
"For this reason, since its foundation, it has been possible to register for "
"the <a href=\"#familias\" class=\"a4\">family route</a>, which is shorter "
"than the full route and suitable for children aged 6 and over. For the 6th "
"Pilgrimage, in 2026, a new registration option will be added: the <a "
"href=\"#minirruta\" class=\"a4\">little-route</a>, adapted for children aged "
"0 to 6, as it is suitable for pushchairs. Details of both routes are "
"described below."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.h2:11-5
msgid "Ruta de familias"
msgstr "Family route"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:13-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+familias.div.h4:3-2"
msgid "¿En qué consiste?"
msgstr "What is it?"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:14-6
msgid ""
"Se camina entre 11 y 14 km al día. Los traslados desde un punto a otro de la "
"ruta se realizan en autobuses de la organización."
msgstr ""
"You will walk between 11 and 14 km a day. Transport between different points "
"along the route is provided by the organisation’s buses."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:15-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+familias.div.h4:5-2"
msgid "¿En qué capítulo se inscriben?"
msgstr "Which chapter do they fall under?"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:16-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+familias.div.p:6-2"
msgid ""
"Los peregrinos que eligen esta ruta están integrados en los capítulos de la "
"ruta completa."
msgstr ""
"Pilgrims who choose this route are integrated into the chapters of the "
"complete route."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:17-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+familias.div.h4:7-2"
msgid "¿Quién puede inscribirse?"
msgstr "Who is eligible to register?"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:18-6
msgid ""
"La edad recomendada para la ruta de familias es entre 6 y 12 años, siempre "
"acompañados por un adulto responsable."
msgstr ""
"The recommended age for the family route is between 6 and 12 years old, "
"always accompanied by a responsible adult."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:25-6
msgid "Primer Día"
msgstr "First day"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:26-6
msgid "De la Virgen de la Cabeza a Los Corros"
msgstr "From Virgen de la Cabeza to Los Corros"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:27-6
msgid "14 km"
msgstr "14 km"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:30-6
msgid "Segundo día"
msgstr "Day two"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:31-6
msgid "De Ceceda a San Román"
msgstr "From Ceceda to San Román"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:32-6
msgid "12,3 km"
msgstr "12.3 km"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:37-6
msgid "Tercer día"
msgstr "Day three"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:38-6
msgid "De Cangas de Onís a Covadonga"
msgstr "From Cangas de Onís to Covadonga"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:39-6
msgid "10,6 km"
msgstr "10.6 km"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.h2:44-5
msgid "Minirruta"
msgstr "Little-route"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:46-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+minirruta.div.h4:3-2"
msgid "¿En qué consiste?"
msgstr "What is it?"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:47-6
msgid ""
"Se camina entre 3 y 5 km al día por asfalto, por lo que es apta para llevar "
"carritos de bebé. El inicio será en un punto establecido por la "
"organización, donde <b class=\"b1\">se deberá acudir en coche</b>, que podrá "
"quedar allí aparcado. Una vez finalizada la ruta, un autobús los llevará de "
"vuelta a los vehículos, que también podrán aparcar en el campamento."
msgstr ""
"The route involves walking between 3 and 5 km per day on paved roads, making "
"it suitable for strollers. The starting point will be designated by the "
"organizers, where <b class=\"b1\">participants must arrive by car</b> and "
"can park there. After completing the route, a bus will take participants "
"back to their vehicles, which can also be parked at the campsite."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:48-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+minirruta.div.h4:5-2"
msgid "¿En qué capítulo se inscriben?"
msgstr "Which chapter do they fall under?"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:49-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+minirruta.div.p:6-2"
msgid ""
"Los peregrinos que eligen esta ruta están integrados en los capítulos de la "
"ruta completa."
msgstr ""
"Pilgrims who choose this route are integrated into the chapters of the "
"complete route."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:50-6
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+minirruta.div.h4:7-2"
msgid "¿Quién puede inscribirse?"
msgstr "Who is eligible to register?"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:51-6
msgid ""
"La edad recomendada para la ruta de familias es entre 0 y 6 años, siempre "
"acompañados por un adulto responsable."
msgstr ""
"The recommended age for the little-route is between 0 and 6 years old, "
"always accompanied by a responsible adult."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:61-6
msgid "Información importante"
msgstr "Important information"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.ul.li:64-6
msgid ""
"Los inscritos deberán desplazarse en coche propio hasta el inicio de la "
"minirruta, donde podrá quedar aparcado y adonde les llevará de vuelta el "
"autobús tras finalizar la ruta."
msgstr ""
"Participants must drive their own cars to the start of the little-route, "
"where they can park and where the bus will take them back after the hike "
"has finished."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.ul.li:65-6
msgid ""
"El uso de autobús es obligatorio. Si no vas a usarlo, no te inscribas en "
"esta modalidad."
msgstr ""
"Use of the bus is compulsory. If you do not intend to use it, please do not "
"register for this option."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.ul.li:66-6
msgid "En esta edición de 2026 las plazas estarán limitadas a un autobús."
msgstr "For the 2026 edition, places will be limited to one bus."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.ul.li:67-6
msgid ""
"Los menores de 3 años no ocupan plaza, por lo que deberán ir en el regazo de "
"su padre/madre."
msgstr ""
"Children under 3 years of age do not occupy a seat, so they must sit on "
"their parent’s lap."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.ul.li:68-6
msgid ""
"Los inscritos recibirán una tarjeta de parking de la organización que les "
"autoriza a aparcar en las plazas habilitadas para ellos, también en el "
"campamento."
msgstr ""
"Those registered will receive a parking pass from the organisers "
"authorising them to park in the spaces designated for them, including at the "
"campsite."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.ul.li:69-6
msgid ""
"La información sobre horarios y ubicaciones se enviará a los inscritos "
"durante las semanas previas a la Peregrinación."
msgstr ""
"Information regarding timetables and locations will be sent to those "
"registered in the weeks leading up to the Pilgrimage."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:75-6
msgid "Minirruta - Primer día"
msgstr "Little-route – Day one"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:76-6
msgid "De la Virgen de la Cabeza a Buenavista"
msgstr "From Virgen de la Cabeza to Buenavista"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.p:80-7
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+main.section.div.div.p:80-7"
msgid "Dificultad:"
msgstr "Difficulty:"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.ul.li:82-8
msgid "Ninguna reseñable."
msgstr "None worth mentioning."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:92-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Recorrido</b>: 3,23km"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Distance</b>: 3.23 km"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:99-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Desnivel Positivo</b>: 14m"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Elevation gain</b>: 14 m"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:106-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Desnivel negativo</b>: 6m"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Elevation drop</b>: 6 m"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:111-6
msgid "Minirruta - Segundo día"
msgstr "Little-route – Day two"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:112-6
msgid "De La Villa Riba a Montecoya"
msgstr "From La Villa Riba to Montecoya"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.p:116-7
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+main.section.div.div.p:116-7"
msgid "Dificultad:"
msgstr "Difficulty:"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.ul.li:118-8
msgid "Pendiente pronunciada en bajada."
msgstr "Steep downhill slope."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:128-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Recorrido</b>: 3,30km"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Distance</b>: 3.30 km"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:135-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Desnivel Positivo</b>: 32m"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Elevation gain</b>: 32 m"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:142-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Desnivel negativo</b>: 101m"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Elevation drop</b>: 101 m"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.h4:147-6
msgid "Minirruta - Tercer día"
msgstr "Little-route – Day three"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:148-6
msgid "Del Parking P2 a Covadonga"
msgstr "From Parking P2 to Covadonga"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.p:152-7
msgctxt "pages/ruta-familias.html+main.section.div.div.p:152-7"
msgid "Dificultad:"
msgstr "Difficulty:"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.ul.li:154-8
msgid "Pendiente pronunciada en subida."
msgstr "Steep incline."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.ul.li:155-8
msgid ""
"Barreras de madera en la última subida (quizá haya que pasar el carrito por "
"encima)."
msgstr ""
"Wooden barriers on the final climb (you may need to lift the pushchair over "
"them)."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.ul.li:156-8
msgid "Se recomienda llevar portabebés."
msgstr "We recommend bringing a baby carrier."

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:166-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Recorrido</b>: 4,85km"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Distance</b>: 4.85 km"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:173-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Desnivel Positivo</b>: 159m"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Elevation gain</b>: 159 m"

#: pages/ruta-familias.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.span.p:180-8
msgid "<b class=\"b1\">Desnivel negativo</b>: 0m"
msgstr "<b class=\"b1\">Elevation drop</b>: 0 m"
